 business activities for which it has yet to earn revenues, for example, start-up operations may be operating segments before earning revenues.","units":{"pure":[{"start":"2024-01-01","end":"2024-12-31","val":1,"accn":"0001213900-25-035802","fy":2024,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F","filed":"2025-04-28","frame":"CY2024"}],"segment":[{"start":"2025-01-01","end":"2025-12-31","val":1,"accn":"0001185185-26-001294","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F","filed":"2026-04-07","frame":"CY2025"}]}},"OperatingExpenses":{"label":"Operating Expenses","description":"Generally recurring costs associated with normal operations except for the portion of these expenses which can be clearly related to production and included in cost of sales or services. Includes selling, general and administrative expense.","units":{"USD":[{"start":"2022-01-01","end":"2022-12-31","val":2368217,"accn":"0001213900-25-035802","fy":2024,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F","filed":"2025-04-28","frame":"CY2022"},{"start":"2023-01-01","end":"2023-12-31","val":1399940,"accn":"0001213900-25-035802","fy":2024,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F","filed":"2025-04-28"},{"start":"2023-01-01","end":"2023-12-31","val":1399940,"accn":"0001185185-26-001294","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F","filed":"2026-04-07","frame":"CY2023"},{"start":"2024-01-01","end":"2024-12-31","val":3890017,"accn":"0001213900-25-035802","fy":2024,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F","filed":"2025-04-28"},{"start":"2024-01-01","end":"2024-12-31","val":3890017,"accn":"0001185185-26-001294","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F","filed":"2026-04-07","frame":"CY2024"},{"start":"2025-01-01","end":"2025-12-31","val":1775422,"accn":"0001185185-26-001294","fy":2025,"fp":"FY","form":"20-F","filed":"2026-04-07","frame":"CY2025"}]}},"OperatingIncomeLoss":{"label":"Operating Income (Loss)","description":"The net result for the period of deducting operating expenses from operating revenues.","units":{"USD":[{"start":"2022-01-01","end":"2022-12-31","val":10195588,"accn":"0001213900-25-035802","fy":2024,"fp":"F